# Where we're stopping today

At this point, you've learned the foundation:

* What authentication is.
* What authorization is.
* Why no authentication isn't enough.
* Username/password login.
* Basic Authentication.
* Why Basic Authentication has limitations.
* Session Authentication.
* What cookies are and how they fit into the picture.

This foundation is essential because everything that comes later builds on it.

